 University health, safety and environmental programs/activities to ensure compliance with federal, state and local occupational safety, health and environmental regulations. Administrative Secretary College of Education Provide secretarial services and administrative assistance to Dean, Executive Director, or equivalent-level administrator. Athletic Academic Program Specialist Intercollegiate Athletics Assist in the administration as well as the continuous development and implementation of a comprehensive support program for all student-athletes in compliance with University, MAC and NCAA regulations. Ready to Apply? First Name (required) ac00be0d Last Name (required) b025dd7c Email (required) 2cbdf96c Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Non-Discrimination Statement Policies Report a Title IX Incident Accessibility Privacy Statement Annual Security Report Copyright © 2022 All Rights Reserved by Eastern Michigan University . Candidate Details × This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalise content such as job recommendations, and to analyse our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device. I do not accept I accept Please choose the category/categories"
